ver, he lacks delicacy in some areas, so he is not the type to last long with a girlfriend.\n-She is good with people. She also gives a cat-like impression to senpai whom she has taken to with open arms.\n\nRelationships.\nHe has given her a duplicate key.\nThey are two younger people who are no match for an older person, and they have said that they will eventually tie the knot.\n\nComposition, etc.\nThe composition, facial expressions, and clothing are all up to you. The closer they are, the better.\n\nUsage\nFor viewing\nUse as a social networking icon\nSharing with partner PL\n\nURL】 【Resource URL\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fOh9IgjSApFi4WZdJp2AtH7DUPoh0Dpe\n\nIf there are any discrepancies in the amount or materials, I would appreciate it if you could resend/cancel the request. Thank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fOh9IgjSApFi4WZdJp2AtH7DUPoh0Dpe", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@MIOU_3O/works/114", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 316504, "client_id": 1393367, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea85a01f/uploads/origins/9e54f781-18c4-4c0b-8e08-f178c41a7823?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5af04205f44f30b7f7ff1b3a369beac", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ea85a01f/uploads/origins/9e54f781-18c4-4c0b-8e08-f178c41a7823?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5af04205f44f30b7f7ff1b3a369beac, https://si.imgix.net/ea85a01f/uploads/origins/9e54f781-18c4-4c0b-8e08-f178c41a7823?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b569bc6520959100d1cc4607a4f2e657 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ea85a01f/uploads/origins/9e54f781-18c4-4c0b-8e08-f178c41a7823?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a67f6f3fa2f842fdc934b8